## The most-read document in the company

::: statement
"Turn it off and on again" — playbook #7, opened 212 times.
:::

---
intent: recap
notes: Three things. If they remember one, make it the middle one.
---
## Three things to remember

- **Incidents are procedures now** — 87 % match a playbook.
- **Nine minutes to respond**, from forty-one.
- **Nights need a decision** — the rotation, by the end of the month.

---
intent: act
notes: One ask. Volunteers sign up on the channel today.
